<Window x:Class="Wff.App.CheatSheetWindow"
        xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        Title="Query cheat sheet" Height="480" Width="560"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterScreen"
        Icon="{DynamicResource AppLogo}">
    <DockPanel Margin="12">
        <Button DockPanel.Dock="Bottom" Content="Close" Padding="16,2"
                HorizontalAlignment="Right" Margin="0,8,0,0" IsCancel="True"/>
        <TextBox FontFamily="Consolas" FontSize="13" IsReadOnly="True"
                 VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Auto"
                 Text="Free text (every word must match, any order):
  invoice 2024

Globs (* = any run, ? = one character):
  *.pdf   2024-*.xlsx

Logical operators (directives stay global):
  invoice [OR] report   [AND] = explicit AND (default)
  invoice [OR] report ext:pdf

Extensions (repeatable = OR, Tab completes, values suggested):
  ext:pdf   ext:pdf ext:docx   ext:.PDF

Sizes (units b k kb m mb g gb t tb; 'size:&gt;1 gb' works):
  size:&gt;10mb   size:&lt;2mb
  size:&gt;=1mb   size:&lt;=1mb   size:=1mb
  size:1mb        (bare = your Exact-size setting)
  size:1.5gb   size:0.5mb
  size:1mb..5mb  (range, inclusive)

Dates (dm:2024-05-10 is the whole local day):
  dm:&lt;7d   dm:7d   dm:&gt;30d      (units h d w m y)
  dm:&lt;12h   dm:&lt;2w   dm:&lt;3m
  dm:today   dm:yesterday
  dm:2024-05-10   dm:&gt;2024-05-01   dm:&lt;2024-05-01
  dm:2024-05-01..2024-05-31

Full path:
  path:Downloads   (= Downloads + full-path mode)
  report-final path:

Combine freely — all filters must pass:
  rep* ext:pdf size:&gt;10kb dm:&lt;30d path:projects

Broken directives glow red and explain in the status line.
There is no sort: token — sorting is Settings -&gt; Search."/>
    </DockPanel>
</Window>
